    "turn_text": "Congressman Barton was a KCBI today and everybody was blessed by that. But Representative Barton, I want to ask you about this announcement by Tony Blair today because it's being spun or at least reported by many in the media as a repudiation of the Bush troop surge policy. Do you see it that way?",
