    "turn_idx": 28,
    "turn_text": "Congressman Joe Barton is the ranking member on the House Committee on Energy and Commerce. And Representative Barton, it looks like there's going to be something either debated or addressed in Congress with regard to the idea of global warming. And of course, you know, people disagree and agree whether it's a real phenomenon, whether humans cause it, and whether we can affect it or change it. How do you expect Congress to address this?",
