    "turn_idx": 72,
    "turn_text": "The particular vaccine that the mandate that the governor ordered is the Gardasil vaccine, which is made by Merck, and it helps the body produce antibodies to four of the HPV viral type. Two of them, numbers 16 and 18, are the two that are responsible for about 70% of the cervical cancer in the United States. And the other two strains are strains that are most commonly produced, what's called gentle towards.",
