    "turn_text": "So you're talking about, I know that we've reported on these, the fact that this vaccine has not been tested on the wider, broader population. But you're talking about some fairly routine reactions to this. But what happens when you take a drug like this and you've tested it, as you said, and you throw it out to the wider population? Are there risks there to our young girls?",
