    "turn_text": "Okay, Linda, I know you and I have talked before, and we've talked about the rights of parents in this situation, and there's certainly our benefits to this for certain people who are going to be sexually active. But you're the mom of an 11-year-old, and you've got a young girl in middle school or entering middle school, and she's got to get this vaccine now, according to the governor, unless something changes. So, you know, what does that do to your right as a parent to control the healthcare of your child?",
