    "turn_text": "You know for that parent and that child they need to continue that because This vaccine does not remove the possibility of cervical cancer or any other sexually transmitted disease, but really does not change the purity message at all. We don't have any vaccine for the emotions of a young girl or a young man, but we need to continue to help them see the benefits of waiting to engage in sexual activity until marriage and to remain monogamous in that relationship.",
