        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker agrees with Gail that the condition in question is a behavioral disease.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Some individuals oppose vaccines and choose to opt out based on philosophical grounds.",
