  },
  {
    "episode_id": 91580,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91580.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 112,
    "turn_text": "I totally believe in that. You know, I'm against, you know, anybody forcing us to do something that goes against our moral beliefs and values because I think that's a personal issue. And, you know, I feel very terribly sorry for anybody who gets cervical cancer. That is a horrible disease. I have a family member that's going through chemotherapy for that very thing right now.",
