        "text": "The HPV vaccine protects only 70% of individuals against cervical cancer.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "One guest made a brief comment that many people likely missed.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
